    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH7x2040-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">Someone said, "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">Nowadays, those who stage a unicorn performance</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">decorate its form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-13a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">covering it on a donkey's back,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-13a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">resembling a strange creature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-13a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">But when they remove its skin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-13a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">it is still just a donkey's ears." *Cháo Yě Qiān Zǎi*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">Gathered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">fireflies shine, but are ultimately not fire;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">dew on lotus leaves is round, but can it really be pearls?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">Bái Lètiān.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">In Qián there were no donkeys.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">A busybody transported one there by boat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">Arriving, it had no use,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">so they released it at the foot of the mountain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">A tiger saw it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">It was a huge thing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">The tiger thought it was a god,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">hiding in the forest to spy on it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">Slowly it came closer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">cautiously, as they did not know each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">One day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">the donkey brayed once.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">The tiger was greatly frightened,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">fleeing far away,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">thinking it would bite him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">It was very afraid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">However, it went back and forth to observe it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">realizing it had no special abilities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">It grew accustomed to its sound.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">Again, it cautiously went back and forth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">ultimately daring not attack it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2040_CHANT_030-14a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-23T21:52:29.57+09:00">It came a little closer.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
